    aspect: 'Number of exams to track',
    ssc: 'One conducting body (SSC) with two main exams (CGL and CHSL) plus a few specialised ones (CPO, JE, Stenographer). One notification cycle a year for CGL.',
    bank: 'Two separate systems: IBPS PO/Clerk (covers 11 banks in one exam) and SBI PO/Clerk (SBI runs its own separate exam). Many aspirants sit both, plus RRB and regional rural bank exams, in the same prep cycle.',
  },
  {
    aspect: 'Posting variety',
    ssc: 'Postings spread across dozens of departments and cities depending on the post you get; some roles (Customs, IB) mean port cities or metros, others (Inspector of Income Tax) mean district or state postings.',
    bank: 'Postings are branch-based within one bank\'s network, which can include rural and semi-urban branches, especially in your first few years — this is a structural part of the role, not an exception.',
  },
];

const syllabusRows = [
