    body: 'SSC CGL currently offers a larger single vacancy pool (thousands more posts than either bank PO exam alone) but pulls a much larger applicant pool too, so raw competition intensity ends up comparable. Bank exams offer fewer total seats per cycle but more cycles per year (IBPS plus SBI plus RRB) if you are willing to prepare across all of them with largely overlapping syllabus.',
    note: 'A wide, once-a-year pool and a narrower, multi-cycle pool carry different risk shapes — pick based on how much attempt frequency actually matters to your specific plan, not just headline vacancy counts.',
  },
